{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":76,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician on Neginoth, A Psalm ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["or"]}," Song of Asaph. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 76:1"},"In Judah ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," God known: his name ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," great in Israel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 76:2"},"In Salem also is his tabernacle, and his dwelling place in Zion. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 76:3"},"There brake he the arrows of the bow, the shield, and the sword, and the battle. Selah. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 76:4"},"Thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," more glorious ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," excellent than the mountains of prey. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 76:5"},"The stouthearted are spoiled, they have slept their sleep: and none of the men of might have found their hands. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 76:6"},"At thy rebuke, O God of Jacob, both the chariot and horse are cast into a dead sleep. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 76:7"},"Thou, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," thou, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," to be feared: and who may stand in thy sight when once thou art angry? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 76:8"},"Thou didst cause judgment to be heard from heaven; the earth feared, and was still, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 76:9"},"When God arose to judgment, to save all the meek of the earth. Selah. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 76:10"},"Surely the wrath of man shall praise thee: the remainder of wrath shalt thou restrain. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 76:11"},"Vow, and pay unto the LORD your God: let all that be round about him bring presents unto him that ought to be feared. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 76:12"},"He shall cut off the spirit of princes: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he is"]}," terrible to the kings of the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 76:12"}]}]}
